USRBIN        ALCASE                             1                     &
USRBIN            12    PHOTON       -26       TGT                    PRP
USRBIN        ALCASE                             1                     &
USRBIN            12    ENERGY       -28       TGT                    EDEP
USRBIN        ALCASE                             1                     &
